Package: CDCLocator
Title: Find HIV Service Providers with the 'HIV.gov' Locator API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vagish", "Hemmige", , "vagish.hemmige@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-6346-1826"))
Description: Queries the 'HIV.gov' Locator application programming interface
    (API) for HIV testing, prevention, care and related service providers near
    a ZIP code, and translates a city and state or a latitude and longitude
    into a ZIP code. Results are returned as tibbles, with a helper that
    flattens nested provider details into one row per provider. The API needs
    a client ID and token, which are read from function arguments or
    environment variables. Not affiliated with or endorsed by 'HIV.gov'.
